The patches for PatchLevel 6 change a line in the delay_output() function
as follows:

PL5/termcap.c(635):              tputs("50", 1, xputs);
PL6/termcap.c(671):              tputs("50", 1, xputc);

Changing the line back to "xputs" from "xputc" seems to fix the throwing
problem described in the previous posting.  I don't know why it was changed 
in PL6... maybe this breaks someone elses termcap.

